:: g3 [g3 raven-wing map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box' style='height: min-content;'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->g3: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Buy something at the vending machine.->g3: vending machine]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'g3'>><<n>><<e>><<w>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'g3'>>
</div>

:: g3: vending machine [g3 raven-wing vending-machine]
<<include 'raven wing: vending machine'>>
[[Return to the map.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]